  "description": "Fairgive Processor Fees: checks Stripe, PayPal, Givebutter or Classy transactions against the fee rates in your settings: fees over the rate, gifts booked net of fees, donor-covered fees, refund fees and payouts missing from the bank. Never moves money.",
